WEBVTT

00:00:07.833 --> 00:00:11.708
We'd always been protected.

00:00:11.708 --> 00:00:15.417
He was as overprotective as he was tough,

00:00:15.417 --> 00:00:20.167
this teacher who'd
done more living than we had.

00:00:22.958 --> 00:00:26.958
"24th Period: Graduation Time"
"by Karma Akabane"

00:00:28.542 --> 00:00:29.625
Kayano...

00:00:29.625 --> 00:00:31.250
Thank goodness you're all right.

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:33.000
Nagisaaa<i>choo</i>!

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.625
Brrr...

00:00:34.625 --> 00:00:37.542
Hey! What's with this getup?!

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.417
Wh-What...

00:00:43.417 --> 00:00:45.250
--Pathetic.
--<i>What </i>is?!

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:47.000
Aw, c'mon--

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.667
Koro Sensei even fixed up your hair for you.

00:00:49.667 --> 00:00:52.917
Thanks... but I wish
he'd fixed up my clothes first.

00:00:52.917 --> 00:00:56.167
Y'know, Koro Sensei's
so generous with his care and all,

00:00:56.167 --> 00:00:59.458
you might've come out of that
a little bustier than before.

00:00:59.458 --> 00:01:02.125
Is that so, Koro Sensei?

00:01:07.917 --> 00:01:11.958
Phew... I'm beat.

00:01:11.958 --> 00:01:17.000
As Koro Sensei collapsed,
he seemed unusually satisfied...

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:20.875
...and unusually frail.

00:01:20.875 --> 00:01:23.000
Class?

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:27.458
What kind of an assassin
would let a dying target escape?

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:31.667
Don't you see?

00:01:31.667 --> 00:01:34.250
It's killing time.

00:01:36.417 --> 00:01:39.375
Fun times...

00:01:39.375 --> 00:01:42.583
...are bound to end.

00:01:42.583 --> 00:01:47.875
That's what a classroom's all about.

00:01:47.875 --> 00:01:51.208
The swelling light of the laser

00:01:51.208 --> 00:01:58.333
told us eloquently, cruelly,
that it was right on schedule.

00:01:58.333 --> 00:01:59.208
We had no time to hesitate.

00:01:59.208 --> 00:02:03.417
"March 12"
We had no time to hesitate.

00:02:04.292 --> 00:02:06.667
Guys...

00:02:06.667 --> 00:02:09.625
We have to decide this ourselves.

00:02:15.417 --> 00:02:20.500
We <i>could </i>choose to stay out
of this and leave it up to fate...

00:02:24.833 --> 00:02:30.125
Show of hands: Who doesn't
want to kill Koro Sensei?

00:02:42.458 --> 00:02:44.792
Okay, hands down.

00:02:47.208 --> 00:02:49.542
Who wants to kill him?

00:03:05.917 --> 00:03:12.375
They were always with us:
our guns, our knives... and our teacher.

00:03:21.250 --> 00:03:24.792
This is our answer.

00:03:26.583 --> 00:03:32.083
We are killers. Our target is our teacher.

00:03:36.542 --> 00:03:42.875
We were all painfully aware
of what we had to do to our mentor

00:03:42.875 --> 00:03:46.417
for us to graduate with our bond still intact.

00:03:58.458 --> 00:04:03.542
"Koro Sensei's Weak Point #33:
Can be captured if everyone holds him down"

00:04:04.583 --> 00:04:08.208
You can't move like this, right, Koro Sensei?

00:04:08.208 --> 00:04:14.458
Exactly so, Nakamura. I <i>am</i>
worried about your weak grip, though.

00:04:19.542 --> 00:04:22.833
We didn't give much thought to the reason--

00:04:22.833 --> 00:04:26.125
that we were doing it to kill him.

00:04:26.125 --> 00:04:32.500
He'd praised us, scolded us,
and nurtured us all year.

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:37.417
Now we all took firm hold
of our teacher's tentacles.

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:44.042
Your heart is under your tie, right?

00:04:44.042 --> 00:04:46.958
Who's going to...

00:04:56.167 --> 00:04:58.125
You guys, please--

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:04.667
Please... let me.

00:05:11.625 --> 00:05:14.375
We got no complaints.

00:05:14.375 --> 00:05:17.458
You're the head of this class, Nagisa.

00:05:34.875 --> 00:05:36.542
Sir...

00:05:44.333 --> 00:05:48.583
Nagisa, you can stab down through my tie.

00:05:50.417 --> 00:05:54.375
The very day I received this tie,
I managed to put a hole in it.

00:05:54.375 --> 00:05:57.333
I left it like that.

00:05:57.333 --> 00:06:00.625
This, too, is an important connection.

00:06:04.292 --> 00:06:09.708
Ah, but first, I have to say
my goodbyes to these teachers.

00:06:09.708 --> 00:06:13.792
Miss Irina, are you sure
you don't want to join in?

00:06:13.792 --> 00:06:16.458
This is your chance at that bounty.

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:21.500
I've gotten enough already.

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:27.583
So many ties, so much experience--
from you and the children both.

00:06:27.583 --> 00:06:32.500
This assassination...
is the bond between you and those kids.

00:06:35.458 --> 00:06:39.875
And Mr. Karasuma--

00:06:39.875 --> 00:06:45.500
You, too, have made
these students what they are today.

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:49.583
Please continue to offer your guidance.

00:06:51.125 --> 00:06:53.917
You may have caused me no end of trouble,

00:06:53.917 --> 00:06:58.208
but this is one year I'll never forget.

00:06:59.667 --> 00:07:03.042
Farewell... Koro Sensei.

00:07:03.042 --> 00:07:04.792
Yes.

00:07:09.083 --> 00:07:13.000
Now then, class, it's about that time.

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:15.917
Twenty-four hours
wouldn't be enough time for me

00:07:15.917 --> 00:07:18.750
to say my goodbyes to each of you in turn.

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:22.833
We can't talk long... so instead,

00:07:22.833 --> 00:07:23.875
"Roll Book"

00:07:23.875 --> 00:07:28.583
"Roll Book"
I'll take attendance one last time.

00:07:29.583 --> 00:07:35.667
Please look me in the eye
and answer in a loud voice.

00:07:35.667 --> 00:07:39.833
Once you've all responded, you can kill me.

00:07:41.792 --> 00:07:44.542
N-Nobody left early, did they?!

00:07:44.542 --> 00:07:48.000
If someone didn't respond <i>now</i>,
of all times, I'd kill myself!

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:49.292
Just do it already!

00:07:49.292 --> 00:07:51.000
"Koro Sensei's Weak Spot #36:
Disorganized when it really counts"

00:07:53.875 --> 00:07:55.542
All right:

00:07:57.375 --> 00:08:00.375
Karma Akabane.

00:08:00.375 --> 00:08:01.625
Here.

00:08:01.625 --> 00:08:04.917
